"| Attribute | NoiseLearner | NoiseLearnerV3 |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Result type | [NoiseLearnerResult](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-result#noiselearnerresult) | [NoiseLearnerV3Results](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-v3-results), a sequence-like container of [NoiseLearnerV3Result](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-v3-result) |\n"
